\subsection{Cross-Scale Analysis}
\label{sec:gen:crossscale}

The preceding analyses use 1--1.5B parameter models.
To test whether depth signal persists in substantially larger generators, we extend the benchmark to Qwen2.5-7B-Instruct~\cite{qwen2.5} under 4-bit NF4 QLoRA fine-tuning, generating depths $d \in \{0, 1, \ldots, 5\}$ with nucleus sampling ($p{=}0.95$, 500 samples per depth).
Feature extraction uses the same reference model (GPT-2 base, 124M) and 19-feature pipeline as all prior experiments.

